    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d298">

                <pb facs="0489" n="419" xml:id="pg419"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>Mr. Campbell to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New Orleans,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-06-15"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 15, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Since the receipt of your despatch of 11th I have been confined to my room by
                    severe bilious attack. My physician says I cannot now go without hazarding my
                    life, especially via Havana and Vera Cruz, where yellow fever prevails. If
                    government considers it important to send minister immediately, I will tender my
                    resignation, if desired.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LEWIS D. CAMPBELL.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
